{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Buy a US non-VoIP phone number for one service, charged to your balance immediately. kind='verification' (default): a one-time number that stays open for up to 15 minutes (expires_at) and can receive several codes in that window. You pay only when an SMS arrives: if none arrives, the full price is refunded automatically and the verification ends as cancelled (rare exception: services marked non-refundable end as expired without a refund). kind='rental': the number is yours for 3/7/14/30 days and receives every SMS for that service; cancel_rental refunds it in full within 60 minutes of purchase. Requires max_price_cents: the price from search_sms_services that you showed the user and they approved. If the price is now higher, nothing is charged and the new price comes back to re-confirm. For a private number that receives SMS from any service, use purchase_dedicated_number. Next: get_rental with the returned id and wait_seconds.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"duration":{"description":"Required when kind='rental'","enum":["3d","7d","14d","30d"],"type":"string"},"kind":{"default":"verification","enum":["verification","rental"],"type":"string"},"max_price_cents":{"description":"The price you showed the user and they approved, in US cents (e.g. 250 = $2.50). Nothing is charged if the current price is higher; the new price comes back so you can ask the user again.","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":1000000,"type":"integer"},"service_id":{"description":"svc_... id from search_sms_services","pattern":"^(?:svc_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64})$","type":"string"}},"required":["service_id","max_price_cents"],"type":"object"},"name":"rent_number","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"rental":{"additionalProperties":